#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"v2-prim-options\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"v2-prim-options\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Options {#options}"
msgstr "Optionen {#options}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Options are specified differently in the V2 primitives in these ways:\n"
msgstr ""
"Optionen werden in den V2-Primitiven auf folgende Weise anders angegeben:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`SamplerV2` and `EstimatorV2` now have separate options classes. You can see"
" the available options and update option values during or after primitive "
"initialization.\n"
msgstr ""
"`SamplerV2` und `EstimatorV2` haben jetzt separate Optionsklassen. Du kannst"
" die verfügbaren Optionen einsehen und Optionswerte während oder nach der "
"Initialisierung des Primitivs aktualisieren.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Instead of the `set_options()` method, V2 primitive options have the "
"`update()` method that applies changes to the `options` attribute.\n"
msgstr ""
"Anstelle der `set_options()`-Methode haben die V2-Primitiv-Optionen die "
"`update()`-Methode, die Änderungen auf das `options`-Attribut anwendet.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a value for an option, it is given a special value of "
"`Unset` and the server defaults are used.\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn du keinen Wert für eine Option angibst, erhält sie den speziellen Wert "
"`Unset` und es werden die Server-Standardwerte verwendet.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"For V2 primitives, the `options` attribute is the `dataclass` Python type.  "
"You can use the built-in `asdict` method to convert it to a dictionary.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bei V2-Primitiven ist das `options`-Attribut vom Python-Typ `dataclass`. Du "
"kannst die eingebaute `asdict`-Methode verwenden, um es in ein Dictionary "
"umzuwandeln.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"See the [API reference](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-"
"runtime/options) for the list of available options.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die Liste der verfügbaren Optionen findest du in der [API-"
"Referenz](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/*Verified EstimatorV2. 2/23 */}\n"
msgstr "{/*Verified EstimatorV2. 2/23 */}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python\n"
"from dataclasses import asdict\n"
"from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
"from qiskit_ibm_runtime import EstimatorV2 as Estimator\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```python\n"
"from dataclasses import asdict\n"
"from qiskit_ibm_runtime import QiskitRuntimeService\n"
"from qiskit_ibm_runtime import EstimatorV2 as Estimator\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"backend = service.least_busy(operational=True, simulator=False)\n"
msgstr ""
"service = QiskitRuntimeService()\n"
"backend = service.least_busy(operational=True, simulator=False)\n"

